This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/validate-suite-pole.sh and the baseline it reads at
docs/suite-pole-baseline.tsv. install.sh copies neither: the validator is not in
core/scripts/, and a consumer tree has no docs/ of this repository's. On a consumer this
fixture would resolve no validator and no baseline, so every arm below would be skipped
and the run could only pass — a narrower check reading identically to a full one.

The guard is dist-only for the same reason validate-plan-shape.sh is: its corpus is a
figure about THIS repository's own fixture suite, taken under this box's pool width, and a
consumer's suite is a different population entirely.
